\cf0\b What changed? \i0 - v1.9\par
\b0 This update adds another highly requested feature - the ability to make sabotageable events.\par

\pard\sa200\sl240\slmult1 To thank you for over 1000 events created with the Event Creator (insane), I decided to work on something that I think most of you will make good use of.\par
\i But first, there is a smaller feature to talk about.\par
\b\i0 I. Cloning events\line\b0 When I first tried making the Sabotageable-Event-Creator feature, I realised that you can't actually / properly \b clone \b0 events. So, from now on, that's possible! (Copy pasting the Event Folder causes issues unless you edit the event.json file, which is a waste of time when the work can be done for you..)\par
